{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act41side_level_act41side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act41side",
  "stageId": "act41side_02",
  "title": "不過別離",
  "storyCode": "EA-2",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ef3a3894aee62d19f7b9f2232f654d38a4bcf1583e2f1d83376161b0cd78a41d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每一條有人住的街道都找過了，沒有提奧的下落，只看到城裡人身上的火……越來越旺盛，就好像忽然起風了一樣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且每個人都習以為常，祛除火焰只會讓他們陷入驚恐，覺得沒有火的部分在離自己遠去……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道納斯爾紗人真的已經……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不，先別想那些，孩子比較重要。該去找一下涅梅絲說過的那位遊牧民布莉吉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但……真有人會因為進不去黑林，就在城門外搭帳篷嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“沿著崗哨右邊走出去，穿過小河”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_campsite_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，好像到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "金色頭髮的佩洛，高高大大，但很靈巧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這應該就是涅梅絲說的“布莉吉”——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你認識我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我們以前應該沒見過，是涅梅絲讓我來找你的。我叫葦草。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拉芙希妮只看見對方往自己身前靠過來，鼻子微微動了兩下，還以為這是什麼遊牧民的招呼方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是城裡那條紅龍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在說什麼？我不是紅龍，我只是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是城裡那條紅龍，你是另一條紅龍。另一條紅龍回到城市裡……好耳熟的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只是聞了聞，就……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，你身上的火的味道和城裡那條紅龍完全不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過這都不重要。葦草，你來找我做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提奧失蹤了，聽說你回城的時候常找他聊天，所以涅梅絲讓我來問你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提奧失蹤了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提奧今天早上出去就沒回家，今天城裡又亂成一團。先是涅梅絲，然後是我，我們找遍了整個納斯爾紗，都找不到他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我離開納斯爾紗前還去找過他，他那時候還好好的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，他那個時候的情況也不算好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎麼說，我找了提奧之後去了趟堡壘，然後就出了城，在那之後就沒見過提奧的影子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該死，他現在到底在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstrongpoint"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提奧——提奧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該死，我當時就該直接把他打暈，扛在肩上帶走的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提奧，說話！這次你必須跟我走了，提奧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布莉吉，這裡是……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戰爭期間這片地塊曾經被拖出去，據說是平定哪裡的貴族什麼的，拖回來就這樣了，掛在納斯爾紗上，一直也沒人修。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提奧只要受了什麼委屈就喜歡跑到這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許提奧真的出城了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我只見過一個出城的人，就是拉格蘭街的艾瑪。當時沒看見提奧和她一起離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且她一個人押著好多東西在黑林外面和人碰面了，那個人把東西拉走，她就一個人回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她沒注意到你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城裡人的眼睛耳朵鼻子都不好，再說了，我們之間有段距離呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好多東西出去，一個人回來……她哪裡來的東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾瑪是做什麼的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她經營一家糧店，我去那裡送過信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糧店……出城……現在閉門不出……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在也只有這點線索了，我們快點過去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g1_citystreets_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1688_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布莉吉？葦草？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好，請問你有沒有看到提奧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1688_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提奧？涅梅絲把這件事交給你了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1688_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有。誰知道那個小子又跑去哪裡了，別真的跟著燒了農業地塊的間諜一起跑了才好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布莉吉，先找人吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那艾瑪呢，你看到她了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1688_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她早早就關店了。我也就是過來繞一下，看她是不是還能開門……唉，白費功夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，又來了，這股冰冷的燒焦味……最近整個納斯爾紗都是這股味道……真難聞啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直想問，你能聞到紫火的氣味？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，那條紅龍身上紫火的焦味，最近連城裡人滿身都是那個味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不只是氣味……火已經蔓延到城裡人身上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？但我沒看見那些人身上有火啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來你也看不見嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還想問你呢，原來你能看見？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不過，唉，想想也是，畢竟你也是紅龍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城裡的人們和那條紅龍離得這麼近，又把她奉若神明，惹火上身確實是早晚的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾瑪，是我，布莉吉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾瑪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鎖孔裡有你說的紫火的味道。肯定有人在裡面。怎麼辦，闖進去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……也只能這樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來紅龍的火還能燒開門鎖？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不管怎麼說，我們先進去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g6_noblelivingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷問者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來，“酷吏”先生，喝一杯吧。雖說沒有宴席，但酒還是能喝到飽的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“酷吏”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷問者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看是誰來了？這不是我們的“守靈人”嗎？你也收到領袖的邀請了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來……呈奉守靈人獻給紅龍的祭器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷問者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我看看守靈人送了什麼好東西過來……哨笛，然後呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夏末節將至，守靈人的確沒有多餘的祭器，只能送來這枚哨笛……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷問者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣就沒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常抱歉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“酷吏”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是你自己信誓旦旦地向我們保證，會帶祭器來為慶典增光嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，是我考慮不周……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了吧，這件事也不是涅梅絲自己提的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從一開始我就說了，一群整天和逝者啊靈魂啊打交道的人，送來的東西也不吉利，還不如就拿來一枚哨笛呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“監察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你被“守靈人”救過，你當然幫她說話了！這件事不能就這樣算了！“守靈人”，你說，這件事要怎麼負責？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安靜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是她一個人能負責的事。真的要追究，守靈人對領袖不敬的這筆帳可以之後再算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祭器的事暫且放下，領袖讓我先來，讓大家先盡興。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "困難期間，一切從簡，本次典禮不設宴席。在領袖駕臨之前，各位就先自行放鬆吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“守靈人”，你先別走。等領袖來了，你得給她一個交待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者你也可以趁現在去巴結幾位大員，讓他們稍後為你美言幾句。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你倒蠻正直的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“校官”先生，這些人……他們真的一向如此嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，一向如此？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“官僚”，他曾經為了銀石崖前線的後勤殫精竭慮，幾日幾夜沒闔眼，累到差點在納斯爾紗的農業地塊昏死過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“酷吏”，他是個鐵石心腸的惡棍，但戰爭期間，納斯爾紗附近囤糧的豪商和貴族只要聽見他的名字，就嚇得雙腿發軟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“拷問者”，我見過他以聽別人哀號和慘叫為樂，但也見過他如同一條發瘋的牙獸，衝入敵人的軍陣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然而現在呢？如果不是殿下否決，城裡已經困難到這種地步，這些人恐怕還想著一頓豐盛的晚宴呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷問者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，我們的“校官”先生還是那麼不合群。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷問者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“官僚”，倒是你，你怎麼了？似乎也提不起勁呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城裡現在缺糧，我有責任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“監察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，糧食歉收，還能怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“監察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（耳語）再說，我不是給你出了一個嫁禍維多利亞人的主意了嗎？那個艾瑪也照你教的說了，城裡人也上鉤了，你現在慌什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“監察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（耳語）就算城裡真的爆發飢荒，那些人把領袖供奉成什麼，肯定也不會針對我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“監察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（耳語）難道那個艾瑪要背叛我們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（耳語）也不是這樣。自從她回來就心神不寧，不過既然已經老老實實照我們說的做，我就不慌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（耳語）我現在擔心的是和艾瑪接應的那個商人，一點音訊都沒有。要是以前，今天上午應該有消息了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“監察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（耳語）那就是有什麼耽誤了吧——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷問者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩位偷偷聊什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個，我們……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“監察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們在說那個英雄庫林的事呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷問者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他？他怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“監察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他當年說的是自己在黑林裡藉著地形弄死了一整隊維多利亞斥候，四五個人，最後剩一個孩子不忍心下手，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“監察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你自己想想，一隊斥候怎麼會帶一個孩子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷問者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？“守靈人”解釋過，那隊斥候是挾持了一幫以前往來塔拉和維多利亞的商隊，幫他們在黑林裡帶路……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“監察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "商隊應該是存在的，但斥候……哼，我看啊，不好說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“但斥候……哼，我看啊，不好說。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "作家講得口渴，抓起杯子仰頭，然而啤酒已經喝光了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我再去為您叫一杯啤酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "神秘的女性起身去了吧台，作家則順勢靠在椅背上。\n多年的習慣讓他盤算著該如何將接下來的部分講得引人入勝，沒想到在盤算時，心裡突然一緊。\n即便這個女人姑且也算是自己的難友，知道一些有的沒的，至少接下來這段自己絕不該像之前那樣和盤托出。\n誰知道她會不會出去亂說。\n這是故事。故事是火映在牆上的影子，而不是火焰本身。講故事的人需要牢記這一點，不然只會被火焰焚身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的啤酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多謝。讓我想想，剛才講到哪裡了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "深池在慶功會上的醜態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，是的，醜態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，這場慶功會真正的主角馬上就要登場……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g6_noblelivingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這場慶功會真正的主角馬上就要登場。\n但在那之前，深池的醜態仍在持續，讓人無法直視。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，我倒是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“酷吏”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我頭頂是不是有什麼東西爬過去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“酷吏”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，天氣都這麼冷了，納斯爾紗竟然還有蟲。你別動，我把牠抓下來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“酷吏”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，這……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "宴會廳突然安靜了下來。\n所有人都盯著“官僚”的頭頂，那裡停著一隻甲蟲。\n純金的甲蟲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“酷吏”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……唔，是你背後的陳設掉下來了。給你，自己放回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“酷吏”把甲蟲從“官僚”頭頂拿下來，放在他的手裡。\n“官僚”鬆了口氣，正想把甲蟲放回原位，甲蟲卻抖了抖嵌滿鑽石的翅膀，往門口飛了一段，落在了大廳中央。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他往前追了兩步，那隻甲蟲彷彿在引誘他，也往前爬了一段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼有趣嗎？“官僚”先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殿下？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我只是想為您追回這隻亂跑的甲蟲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，我又怎麼會責怪你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您不見怪就好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，關於之前向您稟報的祭器的事情——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種小事，無關緊要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真正重要的是，我忠心的僕臣們……你們應當為這場勝利受到獎賞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "愛布拉娜從地上拾起那枚甲蟲，攤平掌心，甲蟲“嗡”的一聲飛向門口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "諸位，我們此刻置身的不是別處，正是過去的蓋爾王陳列珍寶的廳堂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的陳設曾盡數被維多利亞人奪走，而今，我們終於將其中的大多數回歸原位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“官僚”，剛剛那枚甲蟲，正是蓋爾王賜予能臣的獎勵，讚揚他如同不知疲倦的甲蟲，將每一粒穀物收入府庫之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你的確值得擁有牠。如果沒有你，我們的軍隊恐怕已經因飢餓而不知潰散多少次了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去追牠吧，牠是你的了。只要牠還願意停留在你身邊，你就可以執掌徵收穀物的權力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是……是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
